RCULATED to identified stakeholders and interested members of the\u00a0community for feedback and suggestions; and\n\n\n\nb)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 an associated Implementation Plan BE PREPARED for consideration through the next Four-year Strategic Plan process and the associated 2020-2024 Multi-year Budget process;\n\n\n\nit being noted that the attached presentation from the Managing Director, Planning & City Planner was received.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2018-10-15 16:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2018-10-15 Staff Report - Draft Smart City Strategy", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=51567", "date": "2018-10-15 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}, {"empty_flag": false, "title": "2018-10-15 Presentation - Draft Smart City Strategy-1", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=51568", "date": "2018-10-15 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "3": {"title": "Dissolution of the Public Utilities Commission", "number": "3", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by H. Usher", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by T. Park", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, on the recommendation of the Assistant City Solicitor, the proposed by-law appended to the staff report dated October 15, 2018 as Appendix \u201cA\u201d BE INTRODUCED at the Municipal Council meeting on October 16, 2018 for the purpose of dissolving the Public Utilities Commission of the City of London.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "pos